  "Software Details": "Подробности программного обеспечения",
  "The Review Reminder module of eCommerceGo SaaS simplifies the process of gathering valuable feedback from your customers. Once customers receive their orders, this module automatically sends them reminders to leave reviews. With this feature, you can effortlessly collect feedback, improve customer satisfaction, and boost sales.": "Модуль напоминания об отзыве в eCommerceGo SaaS упрощает процесс сбора ценных отзывов от ваших клиентов. ",
